51
00:04:19.568 --> 00:04:26.130
NARRATOR: Asymptotic notation describes how
resource use grows with input size.

52
00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:34.802
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: Using
Big-O notation, a linear scan is O(n) while a

53
00:04:34.802 --> 00:04:42.896
