61
00:05:17.825 --> 00:05:24.497
NARRATOR: A loop invariant supports a proof by
initialization, maintenance, and termination.

62
00:05:24.497 --> 00:05:32.073
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: In a loop
that sums an array, the invariant 'sum equals

63
00:05:32.073 --> 00:05:39.649
